SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_CyndyIntro::
    .string "My conditioning's in top form!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_CyndyDefeat::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "Something's not right…$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_CyndyPostBattle::
    .string "The way I am now, I may have to\n"
    .string "hold off on TRAINER TOWER…$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_EvanIntro::
    .string "It doesn't matter if you happen to\n"
    .string "have the strongest POKéMON…\p"
    .string "It doesn't mean a thing if you don't\n"
    .string "know how to use them properly!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_EvanDefeat::
    .string "You're a master at this.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_EvanPostBattle::
    .string "You see them every so often,\n"
    .string "TRAINERS with awesome POKéMON\l"
    .string "who have no idea what to do.\p"
    .string "Before training POKéMON, TRAINERS\n"
    .string "themselves need to grow up.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_JacksonIntro::
    .string "I work to protect the environment.\n"
    .string "In turn, nature protects me!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_JacksonDefeat::
    .string "Whoa! You're tough!\n"
    .string "How about protecting me?$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_JacksonPostBattle::
    .string "From far out among the stars, our\n"
    .string "planet is just a drop of water.\p"
    .string "But we want to protect that drop\n"
    .string "of water for everyone.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_KatelynIntro::
    .string "Those shoes you have are pretty\n"
    .string "snazzy.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_KatelynDefeat::
    .string "You're hot stuff in spite of your\n"
    .string "cute looks.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_KatelynPostBattle::
    .string "Your mom bought those snazzy\n"
    .string "RUNNING SHOES for you?\p"
    .string "She must adore you.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LeroyIntro::
    .string "You look strong.\n"
    .string "Let me battle you, please!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LeroyDefeat::
    .string "I knew it!\n"
    .string "You're as tough as I thought!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LeroyPostBattle::
    .string "The way you battle has given me\n"
    .string "a lot of useful data.\p"
    .string "Thanks so much!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_MichelleIntro::
    .string "I was given the best possible\n"
    .string "education to become this strong.\p"
    .string "I don't want to lose to anyone!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_MichelleDefeat::
    .string "Thank you. I feel like I've been\n"
    .string "set free by losing to you.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_MichellePostBattle::
    .string "For some reason, I get furious\n"
    .string "over the slightest thing.\p"
    .string "I'll calm myself by breathing\n"
    .string "deeply.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LexIntro::
    .string "LEX: My darling NYA, together\n"
    .string "we could win!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LexDefeat::
    .string "LEX: I seem to have been too\n"
    .string "careless…$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LexPostBattle::
    .string "LEX: I think it was a good\n"
    .string "experience for NYA.\p"
    .string "You have my gratitude.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LexNotEnoughMons::
    .string "LEX: May I ask you to battle the\n"
    .string "both of us at the same time?$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_NyaIntro::
    .string "NYA: I'll do my best so I won't\n"
    .string "drag down my mentor, LEX!$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_NyaDefeat::
    .string "NYA: Oh, no…\n"
    .string "I'm so sorry, I…$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_NyaPostBattle::
    .string "NYA: I think I'm going to need\n"
    .string "much more seasoning and tutoring\l"
    .string "under LEX…\p"
    .string "…So, LEX, please, may I stay with\n"
    .string "you like this?$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_NyaNotEnoughMons::
    .string "NYA: I'm sorry, but may we battle\n"
    .string "in two-on-two style?$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "SEVAULT CANYON\n"
    .string "TANOBY RUINS AHEAD$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_BrunoTrainedWithBrawly::
    .string "Training by oneself is certainly\n"
    .string "not a bad thing.\p"
    .string "But it's also not bad to aim for\n"
    .string "the top with a partner.\p"
    .string "Even BRUNO…\n"
    .string "He trained with a fellow by the\l"
    .string "name of BRAWLY before.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilver1::
    .string "SILVER: ...You came. All the way\n"
    .string "to the edge of time.\p"
    .string "The ECHO showed me something.\n"
    .string "A boy in a dark room, waiting\l"
    .string "for a man who never came back.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanni1::
    .string "...I saw it too, SILVER.\p"
    .string "I left because I was afraid of\n"
    .string "what I would turn you into.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilver2::
    .string "SILVER: Afraid?! You left me alone!\p"
    .string "I became strong so you would\n"
    .string "look at me. Just once.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanni2::
    .string "I looked.\p"
    .string "Every single day, from far away.\p"
    .string "I am proud of you, son.\n"
    .string "I never knew how to say it.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilver3::
    .string "SILVER: ...\p"
    .string "Then do not say it.\n"
    .string "Show me. Let me earn it.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilver4::
    .string "SILVER: {PLAYER}. Fight us. Both of\n"
    .string "us, back to back. No rest between.\p"
    .string "If you cannot stand before the\n"
    .string "two of us, you cannot stand\l"
    .string "before the ECHO.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilverDefeat::
    .string "I lost. But for the first time...\n"
    .string "I do not mind.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilver5::
    .string "SILVER: Thank you. I will walk\n"
    .string "beside him now. Not behind.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanni3::
    .string "GIOVANNI: CHAMPION. No pause. Let\n"
    .string "me see what my son measured\l"
    .string "himself against.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanniDefeat::
    .string "Hm. The earth bows to you.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanni4::
    .string "GIOVANNI: ...So that is what it\n"
    .string "looks like. A trainer worth\l"
    .string "following.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanni5::
    .string "GIOVANNI: And you, RED. Still\n"
    .string "standing there in silence.\p"
    .string "We never settled it, you and I.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneRed1::
    .string "...$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanni6::
    .string "GIOVANNI: Not today. Today I walk\n"
    .string "home with my son.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilver6::
    .string "SILVER: ...Come on. Father.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneRed2::
    .string "RED: ...\p"
    .string "(He tips his cap to you and\n"
    .string "smiles for the very first time.)$"


SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G0Intro::
    .string "The little guardian sleeps in the\n"
    .string "grove. Not one step further.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G0Defeat::
    .string "Wilted...$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G0Post::
    .string "The WARDEN waits at the top.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G1Intro::
    .string "Time folds around it. We keep the\n"
    .string "grove from folding with it.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G1Defeat::
    .string "Pruned.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G1Post::
    .string "Keep climbing. It gets greener.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G2Intro::
    .string "No one should reach the top alone.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G2Defeat::
    .string "Snapped.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G2Post::
    .string "The WARDEN has felt you coming.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G3Intro::
    .string "The forest spirit gave us shelter\n"
    .string "when the sky turned. We stay.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G3Defeat::
    .string "Uprooted.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G3Post::
    .string "Almost there. Mind your pride.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G4Intro::
    .string "I am the WARDEN of the GROVE.\n"
    .string "The little one sleeps in my care.\p"
    .string "Prove that your will is worth\n"
    .string "more than my fear.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G4Defeat::
    .string "...Then the grove has chosen you.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_G4Post::
    .string "Go. Let it sleep after.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_GuardsLeft::
    .string "The beast does not stir.\n"
    .string "Its guardians still stand watch.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W0Intro::
    .string "The tide keeps this canyon.\n"
    .string "Turn back, or be washed away.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W0Defeat::
    .string "Ebbed...$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W0Post::
    .string "The grove is open. Mind the top.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W1Intro::
    .string "Fire and earth sleep above.\n"
    .string "None wake them on my watch.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W1Defeat::
    .string "Burnt out...$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W1Post::
    .string "The way is open. Go on.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W2Intro::
    .string "The sky dragon dreams up there.\n"
    .string "You must earn the wind first.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W2Defeat::
    .string "Grounded...$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W2Post::
    .string "Go on. The wind allows it.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W3Intro::
    .string "I am the last guardian of the\n"
    .string "dreamers. The eon twins and the\n"
    .string "wish star rest behind me.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W3Defeat::
    .string "Awake at last...$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_W3Post::
    .string "Go. Be gentle with them.$"


SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_GroveLocked::
    .string "A mossy cave mouth. Something small\n"
    .string "stirs within. Not yet.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_GladeLocked::
    .string "A small, mossy cave mouth. Nothing\n"
    .string "stirs inside. Not yet.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SummitLocked::
    .string "A dark passage climbs into the\n"
    .string "clouds. The ECHO is still silent.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneEnd::
    .string "The sky falls silent. Behind the\n"
    .string "peak, a dark passage has opened.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_GroveHint::
    .string "The GROVE is sealed. The ECHO\n"
    .string "calls from the passage to the east.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SummitPassLocked::
    .string "A dark passage in the rock. The\n"
    .string "air within hums. Not yet.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneSilverRed::
    .string "SILVER: RED trains here again, on\n"
    .string "the highest peak. I came for a\l"
    .string "rematch. He has not answered yet.$"

SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_SceneGiovanniKnew::
    .string "GIOVANNI: I knew I would find you\n"
    .string "both here. The strong always end\l"
    .string "up at the top of the world.$"
